{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"尖沙咀兩名女子遭的士撞傷送院\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-TST-261124-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】尖沙咀兩名女子被的士撞傷送院。</p><p>其中一名女子腳部受傷，送到伊利沙伯醫院治理。凌晨3時許，現場消息指，兩名內地女子乘坐的士在康達徑近科學館徑落車期間，與的士司機發生爭執，的士開車離開時，懷疑撞到該兩名女子，警方正調查案件。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:22:59.662514+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":118,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-23T23:24:25+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-25T04:37:12.367718+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T00:16:34.792137+00:00","content_hash":"8274c1b2d419301e06aa07334e3ebb5c5b19f86873748d2475f323630ea3401a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-24T00:22:59.662514+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}